            "custom_icon_width": 50,
            "title": "600,000+ Satisfied Customers",
            "content": "<p>More than 600,000 discerning home enthusiasts just like you have discovered the perfect piece for their home with William Wood. Spread your payments over 3 months at no additional cost.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_Tatrt": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "icon": "picto-return-box",
            "custom_icon": null,
            "custom_icon_width": 50,
            "title": "100% Free Returns",
            "content": "<p>Unhappy with your purchase? No problem. Returns are 100% free. We’ll even handle the collection for you, making returning your William Wood purchase effortless. For more information on our returns process, tap <a href=\"/pages/deliveries\" title=\"/pages/deliveries\">here.</a> </p>"
